+    """Processing demand of one class of LLM calls on one instance.
+
+    ``concurrency`` is the steady-state number of active decode sequences on
+    the target instance.  It scales the decode stage only, because every
+    resident sequence contributes one token per iteration.  A prefill chunk,
+    in contrast, is admitted and executed as one representative chunk, so its
+    cost is evaluated at the reference concurrency given by
+    ``prefill_concurrency``.
+    """
     prompt = max(1, int(round(prompt_tokens)))
     output = max(1, int(round(output_tokens)))
